      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Multi-shot video with camera control**\n\n1. **Multi-Shot Prompt** holds the shots and their seconds. Edit the text to change the story.\n2. **Camera & Lens** (one per clip) sets shot size, camera move, lens and lighting from lists.\n3. Press **Run**. Clip 1 hands its **last_frame** to clip 2 as the first frame, so the two clips continue each other.\n\nSwap models, shots and presets freely.\n\n**First time?** Paste your HashBidX key into the **HashBidX API Key** box above and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key, and every template is ready to run."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**Multi-shot video with camera control**\n\n1. **Multi-Shot Prompt** holds the shots and their seconds. Edit the text to change the story.\n2. **Camera & Lens** (one per clip) sets shot size, camera move, lens and lighting from lists.\n3. Press **Run**. Clip 1 hands its **last_frame** to clip 2 as the first frame, so the two clips continue each other.\n\nSwap models, shots and presets freely.\n\n**First time?** Paste your HashBidX key into the **HashBidX API Key** box above and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key, and every template is ready to run."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
